{"3655670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vesperis", "steam_appid": 3655670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️ Please Note:</strong> <strong>Vesperis is focused on exploration and atmosphere. The journey unfolds within a dense environment, featuring puzzles and a narrative that gradually reveals itself as you progress through the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Add Vesperis to your wishlist if you enjoy psychological horror games — it really helps me a lot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vesperis is a first-person psychological horror game, filled with puzzles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay:</u></strong><u> The game focuses on exploring environments and solving puzzles to advance the narrative.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious event, your grandmother was taken by supernatural forces and passed away. As you investigate what happened, you will face unknown horrors and unearth secrets that challenge reality, threatening your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, supernatural forces emerge to challenge your limits. Explore every room in your grandmother’s enormous house, discover hidden passages, and confront horrors that hide in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655670/extras/9e9916b7212aa24213b9962af4bf8227.poster.avif?t=1780332499\" width=520 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655670/extras/9e9916b7212aa24213b9962af4bf8227.webm?t=1780332499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️ Please Note:</strong> <strong>Vesperis is focused on exploration and atmosphere. The journey unfolds within a dense environment, featuring puzzles and a narrative that gradually reveals itself as you progress through the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Add Vesperis to your wishlist if you enjoy psychological horror games — it really helps me a lot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vesperis is a first-person psychological horror game, filled with puzzles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay:</u></strong><u> The game focuses on exploring environments and solving puzzles to advance the narrative.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a mysterious event, your grandmother was taken by supernatural forces and passed away. As you investigate what happened, you will face unknown horrors and unearth secrets that challenge reality, threatening your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, supernatural forces emerge to challenge your limits. Explore every room in your grandmother’s enormous house, discover hidden passages, and confront horrors that hide in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655670/extras/9e9916b7212aa24213b9962af4bf8227.poster.avif?t=1780332499\" width=520 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655670/extras/9e9916b7212